e75ff7f0ff4e92a8a50e9899935","event_uuid":"36eadbc4-cb63-4ba2-acae-7fc5b2cc73b1","position":{"commit_sha":"d621c9b81307aae90a396be1ba5b90dd702c2dc0","position":"1788457099983634001-36eadbc4-cb63-4ba2-acae-7fc5b2cc73b1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"8e8328930ebc0122e89b0ab6b9b8b375214dec3e6a564fa292304ab201929ce4","event_uuid":"d4e83ad5-1071-424c-995f-8d87dc6bc994","position":{"commit_sha":"62b3293c19e461a0324c91506c7a2d5795b18118","position":"1788457109937745001-d4e83ad5-1071-424c-995f-8d87dc6bc994"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Implemented the dead Jira helper cleanup. Removed the unused Cloud _fit_description helper and retargeted the remaining prose/tests to the shared OutboundFieldMapper plus RichTextCodec composition; removed the dead _direct_rest_put issue-property wrapper and kept issue-property/reporter/unassign behavior on the concrete raw-PUT writes. Validation: focused Jira adapter/raw-PUT/rich-text suites passed; make lint and make typecheck passed; pytest -m \"not integration and not external\" still stops only on the pre-existing baseline test_atomic_completion_close::test_relevant_remote_rejection_never_places_candidate_on_shared_head.","timestamp":1788433384964477001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1788315160454796001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"67f1c5cc-0a4c-492d-971b-6830e12b979d","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"a07a-5eeb-1223-491c"},{"link_uuid":"66402200-7adc-41d2-aabc-0e8af23f0c7b","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"dcfd-1a76-8796-4838"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nThe Cloud Jira adapter still carries two dead private helpers. backend.py::_fit_description no longer has an executable consumer because the live send-path composition moved to the shared OutboundFieldMapper built with AdfCodec. acli_rest.py::_direct_rest_put also has no production caller and preserves the wrong issue-property envelope shape; the live issue-property, reporter, parent, and unassign flows already use concrete raw PUT writes instead.\n\nBecause both helpers are named in docstrings and held-out inventories, this cleanup must remove the dead code and retarget every surviving prose/test consumer to the real owners rather than leaving dangling references.\n\n## Approach\n\n1. Remove backend.py::_fit_description and keep Cloud description composition owned by the shared OutboundFieldMapper plus RichTextCodec path.\n2. Update every prose/test consumer that still names _fit_description: adapters/jira/jira_fields.py, adapters/jira_family/rich_text.py, adapters/jira/backend.py comment prose, and tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_rich_text_seam_heldout.py.\n3. Remove acli_rest.py::_direct_rest_put and keep set_issue_property, set_reporter, set_parent, and unassign semantics on the concrete raw PUT implementations already used in production.\n4. Update every stale _direct_rest_put consumer or inventory: adapters/jira/acli_rest.py comments, adapters/jira/acli.py unassign prose, tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_cloud_rate_limit_sweep_heldout.py, and tests/scripts/bridge/test_jira_capability_probe.py.\n5. Re-run focused Jira adapter/rich-text/raw-PUT suites, then lint, typecheck, and the default make test selector, treating test_atomic_completion_close::test_relevant_remote_rejection_never_places_candidate_on_shared_head as the known pre-existing baseline failure if it is the only remaining broad-suite miss.\n\n## Scope\n\n- src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira/backend.py\n- src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira/jira_fields.py\n- src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_family/rich_text.py\n- src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira/acli_rest.py\n- src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira/acli.py\n- tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_rich_text_seam_heldout.py\n- tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_cloud_rate_limit_sweep_heldout.py\n- tests/scripts/bridge/test_jira_capability_probe.py\n\n## Testing\n\nRun focused rich-text seam, raw-PUT transport, Cloud unassign, capability-probe, and Jira adapter inventory suites; then run make lint, make typecheck, and pytest -m \"not integration and not external\" -x -q.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] backend.py::_fit_description is removed.\n- [x] Cloud rich-text prose points at the shared OutboundFieldMapper plus RichTextCodec composition instead of the deleted helper.\n- [x] test_rich_text_seam_heldout.py guards the helper-name cleanup while preserving the send-path composition oracle.\n- [x] acli_rest.py::_direct_rest_put is removed.\n- [x] Issue-property, reporter, parent, and unassign paths still use the concrete raw PUT writes they used before the cleanup.\n- [x] The stale _direct_rest_put inventory/mock sites in test_cloud_rate_limit_sweep_heldout.py and test_jira_capability_probe.py are updated.\n- [x] Focused Jira adapter/rich-text/raw-PUT suites pass.\n- [x] make lint and make typecheck pass.\n- [x] pytest -m \"not integration and not external\" -x -q fails only on the known pre-existing atomic completion baseline test.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira/backend.py","reason":"remove the dead Cloud _fit_description helper while keeping outbound mapping delegated to the shared mapper"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira/jira_fields.py","reason":"retarget Cloud rich-text sanitizer prose to the surviving OutboundFieldMapper plus RichTextCodec composition"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira_family/rich_text.py","reason":"update the RichTextCodec seam documentation to name the shared Cloud send-path owner after helper removal"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira/acli_rest.py","reason":"remove the dead wrapped PUT helper and keep issue-property writes on the concrete raw PUT transport"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/adapters/jira/acli.py","reason":"retarget unassign transport prose after removing the dead wrapped PUT helper"},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_rich_text_seam_heldout.py","reason":"guard that Cloud send-path prose no longer references the deleted helper name"},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_cloud_rate_limit_sweep_heldout.py","reason":"keep the Cloud mutation transport inventory aligned after removing the dead wrapped PUT helper"},{"path":"tests/scripts/bridge/test_jira_capability_probe.py","reason":"drop the stale dead-helper mock from probe coverage"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["depends_on","a07a-5eeb-1223-491c"],["parent","78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86"],["relates_to","dcfd-1a76-8796-4838"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","parent_status_uuid":"36eadbc4-cb63-4ba2-acae-7fc5b2cc73b1","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["janitor","dead-code","jira","hardening","sdc4"],"ticket_id":"79fb-2c91-241c-4a9d","ticket_type":"task","title":"Remove dead Jira adapter description and PUT helpers","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["438a0e06-21ca-4058-a085-ebe427b39ef3","ea4963b4-cb4e-4ef1-82ab-4f2bdd8ea093","ed0a1f6a-c196-43d7-a4de-3fd6a2258697","55b0c9a5-11dd-44b9-b7d6-51d35585d3e8","fa5676ca-eb46-421e-8b16-aa38f4f2722a","ebc2f1a8-1169-44f3-94c7-d0b0105d299a","e6535e1b-f24b-4cb3-a2a6-5a3f675bcd66","66402200-7adc-41d2-aabc-0e8af23f0c7b","07396ef2-7b94-43ff-b7ec-7c20dd764976","104da43d-2112-481e-93e8-bdbc264bfeab","36eadbc4-cb63-4ba2-acae-7fc5b2cc73b1","d4e83ad5-1071-424c-995f-8d87dc6bc994"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788459404303270348,"uuid":"d2802a65-2797-4f23-acbc-8f054f3ef96e"}